Many animals are in danger. There are only a few snow leopards in the mountains. The blue whale, the biggest animal in the world, needs a clean ocean. Orangutans are losing their forests. A poacher hunts animals, which is against the law. Rangers protect animals in the wildlife park, and vets help them at the rescue centre. The giant panda is safer now!

